<div n="6"><head><hi rendition="#aq">a.</hi><lb/>
<hi rendition="#g">Ding an &#x017F;ich und Exi&#x017F;tenz.</hi></head><lb/>
<p>1. Das <hi rendition="#g">Ding an &#x017F;ich</hi> i&#x017F;t das Exi&#x017F;tirende als<lb/>
